  "id": "26",
  "title": "Proxies & Gateways",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12) 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06B6D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon is a high-density **API Gateway**. Leverage zero-copy streaming and a pre-compiled routing matrix to forward millions of requests per second with negligible latency.</p></div><h2>The Connectivity Mesh</h2><p>Building a reverse proxy shouldn't involve complex configurations. Photon provides a fluent, programmable mesh that handles header cleaning and hop-by-hop protocols automatically.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AUTO_HYGIENE</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Automatic removal of hop-by-hop headers (Connection, Upgrade, etc.) and injection of <code>X-Forwarded</code> metadata.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9\"/><path d=\"M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">STREAM_THRU</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Direct kernel-level body streaming. No buffering, zero heap allocation during heavy payload forwarding.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><polyline points=\"7.5 4.21 12 6.81 16.5 4.21\"/><polyline points=\"7.5 19.79 7.5 14.6 3 12\"/><polyline points=\"21 12 16.5 14.6 16.5 19.79\"/><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">DNS_RESOLVE</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Native Bun resolver support for high-throughput service discovery and intelligent retry strategies.</p></div></div><h2>Programmable Dispatch</h2><p>Transform, rewrite, and secure your traffic using the <code>forward()</code> method. It combines routing level directives with individual control.</p><pre><code>// 1. Declarative Router Forwarding\napp.forward('all', '/legacy/*', 'https://old-service.internal')\n\n// 2. Programmable Logic inside Handler\napp.all('/proxy/*', async (c) => {\n  return await c.forward('https://target.com', {\n    rewritePath: (p) => p.replace('/proxy', ''),\n    headers: { 'X-Proxy-By': 'Photon-Gateway' }\n  })\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #06B6D4; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// GATEWAY_SPEC: ZERO_COPY_HANDSHAKE</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Photon's forwarder doesn't parse the incoming request body unless explicitly asked. It passes the raw TCP stream directly to the target, resulting in O(1) memory usage regardless of request size.</p></div><h2>Performance: Gateway Overhead</h2><p>Proxy latency comparison between Photon (AOT) and traditional JS Gateway implementations.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_ZERO_COPY_FORWARD</span> <span>~0.12ms Latency</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 10%; background: #06B6D4; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6,182,212,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>RECURSIVE_PROXY_HANDLER</span> <span>~2.40ms Latency</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 90%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// METRIC: PHOTON ADDS VIRTUALLY ZERO OVERHEAD TO THE NETWORK HOP</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Architect's Insight:</strong> Most gateways fail at high concurrency due to buffer exhaustion. Photon's stream-through architecture treats every request as a pipe, ensuring your memory remains flat whether you have 10 or 10,000 active tunnels.</p></div>",
